   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indicator 1</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Investment for a 60 MW solar plant reached financial close 
Achievement: N 
Progress/Status: The project was awarded to Prime Road Alternatives on 24 Oct 2019 and the power purchase agreement was signed on 30 Jun 2020. 

All required infrastructures in the solar park have been completed and fully operational. 

Energizing (with one circuit) was commissioned in November 2022 and energizing (with double circuits) was done in April 2023. 
Data Source: EDC annual reports 
Base year: 2019 
Baseline value: N</narrative>
