   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indicator 2</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Investments for an additional 40 MW of solar plant capacity tendered 
Achievement: N 
Progress/Status: Bids were opened on 17 Feb 2021, following the launched of the tender in December 2020. 14 bids from 8 different countries competed in the bid. 

Technical bids were opened on 27 July 2021 and BAFO opening for the three shortlisted companies was done on 21 October 2021. 

The successful bidder (Trina Solar Co. Ltd) was awarded the contract on 9 May 2022 and power purchase agreement was signed as well. 
Data Source: EDC annual reports 
Base year: 2019 
Baseline value: N</narrative>
